/E ([0023]  Thus the governing equation of the hook has been derived using trigonometric identities to eliminate the 20 unknowns with assuming the respective mechanism structure. The final kinematic cutting mechanism can be used in cases of precise cutting and eliminating any discrepancies during cutting. The entire motion is done in 3 phases viz.  hooking phase, pulling phase and holding phase. Thus the final model can be 3D printed and tested in real world with tomatoes as shown in Figure 8. The design can further be improved by )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [142]
